\f2\b\fs36 \cf0 Lived Experiences, Stigma & Public Health\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec5 We develop computational methods to understand how people describe substance use, recovery, stigma, sensitive experiences, and support across digital spaces, and how language technologies can reduce rather than reproduce harm.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

