\f2\b\fs36 \cf0 Relational AI & Mental Health\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec5 We study AI systems that participate in emotionally sensitive interactions, connecting model behavior to therapeutic processes, human judgments of empathy, and evidence from how people actually use AI for mental-health support.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

